summary:
  Somebody coming to the player's window is not told to the poll.

history:
  At the slow rate the last reading can be half a minute old. On a desktop
  face the pointer's arrival re-arms the poll at once; the window is the
  other seat that never closes and needs the same word.

target:
  package/contents/ui/PlayerWindow.qml

find:
      onFaceWatchedChanged: if (faceWatched && WindowLogic.standing(seat, planar)) arrived()

replace:
      onFaceWatchedChanged: if (faceWatched && planar) arrived()

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_playerwindow.qml::test_arriving_at_a_window_or_a_desktop_face_is_told_once_each_time.
